{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10445","headline":"送别 · 高适","name":"送别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昨夜离心正郁陶，三更白露西风高。\n萤飞木落何淅沥，此时梦见西归客。\n曙钟寥亮三四声，东邻嘶马使人惊。\n揽衣出户一相送，唯见归云纵复横。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10445.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10445","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗镜》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩鏡_(四庫全書本)）"}